{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person driving adventure and scavenging survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a sudden, mysterious blizzard, the world has fallen into ruin. You drive a heavily modified steam-powered truck, heading north\u2014toward the rumored origin of the catastrophe. The extreme cold is your greatest enemy, threatening not only your body but also your truck\u2019s boiler, water tank, and fragile pipes. Searching forests and ruins buried in snow for supplies is your only way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How far can you go? What secrets will you uncover? And can you ultimately learn the truth behind it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This steam truck is your only home in a frozen world:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/truck.png?t=1748589153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the boiler running with a constant supply of fuel:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/add_fuel.png?t=1748589153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade truck parts to boost performance:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/upgrade.png?t=1748589153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a small shelter on the truck\u2019s rear platform:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/build.png?t=1748589153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive, scavenge, cook, craft, and forge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/plant_cook_drive.png?t=1748589153\" /><br>Create your own journey through a frozen wasteland.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728790?t=1748589153","background_raw":